// CANDIDATE: pre-2022 RuneScape transcript 18411641, lines 419–422.
// Ordinary greeting: Old School NPC transcript 11364029 (2020).
// Missing quest branches and transitions: Old School quest transcript 15325427.
// The post-2022 Hakeem form and its new-citizen conversation are not used.
[opnpc1,feud_mayor_geom]
if (%feud_var = ^feud_mayor_reveal) {
    ~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Thank you once again. Have you spoken to Ali Morrisane yet?");
    ~chatplayer("<p,neutral>No not yet.");
    ~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Perhaps you should! I'm sure he's keen to hear word of his nephew.");
    return;
}
if (%feud_var = ^feud_bandits_defeated) @feud_mayor_nephew;
if (%feud_var = ^feud_menaphites_defeated) @feud_mayor_consequences;
if (%feud_var >= ^feud_jewels_taken & %feud_var < ^feud_menaphites_defeated) {
    ~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I really can't chat for very long, the recent escalation in crime has me run off my feet. Just a short while ago even my own house was robbed. This cannot continue.");
    return;
}
if (%feud_var >= ^feud_camels_delivered & %feud_var < ^feud_jewels_taken) {
    ~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I really can't chat for very long, the recent escalation in crime has me run off my feet. There are muggings and burglaries happening in broad daylight! It's really not on.");
    return;
}
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Welcome adventurer to the town of Pollnivneach, the gateway to Menaphos and Al-Kharid. My name is Ali and I'm the mayor of this town. I hope you enjoy your stay here.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Thank you. That is the warmest welcome I've had anywhere for a while at least. People generally treat travelling adventurers with suspicion.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>All are welcome here, such is the way of things in border regions. Now more than ever I suppose.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>What do you mean by that?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>There's trouble in town, and a lot of villagers have left as a result.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I'm looking for someone called Ali.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I doubt that's easy in Pollnivneach.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Well can you help me?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I'm more than a little busy at the moment, I'm sure there are plenty of people in town who could help you.");
return;

[label,feud_mayor_consequences]
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I don't know what we did to deserve your presence here, but I for one am filled with regret.");
~chatplayer("<p,angry>Well that's some show of gratitude! Can't I even get a 'thank you' for ridding your town of one of the gangs?");
~chatnpc("<p,quiz>Do you understand the concept of consequences?");
~chatplayer("<p,quiz>Er, I think so?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Well, the consequences of your little piece of butchery are that the town is now even worse off. The bandits no longer have to waste time and energy fighting with the Menaphites and can direct all their attention");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>towards making us miserable. So for your efforts I thank you, but I wish no-one had asked for your help.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I'll set this town right before I leave, I promise.");
~chatnpc("<p,shock>Why do I wish that you hadn't said that? Your heavyhanded tactics scare me.");
return;

[label,feud_mayor_nephew]
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>My thanks, your methods and motives may be questionable but nonetheless thank you for delivering this town from those wicked individuals.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I think now that our problems are at a manageable size, mistakes made in the past will not be repeated.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>The least that I can do for you is answer your questions about the whereabouts of Ali Morrisane's nephew.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>He was asked to leave the town as much for concerns for his health and, as sad as it is to admit, the anger of our towns people.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>He is a good lad but is too good a salesman for his health. He angered a number of people by coercing them into buying things they really didn't want.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>He acted completely within the letter of the law... but that could only protect him so long. Once he angered the Menaphites and the Bandits I could no longer protect him and he had to go.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I can assure you that he is safe and well and now that the threats to his life no longer hold any water he plans to open some kind of superstore with forty of his disreputable friends.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>A 'treasure trove' he claims. I will believe it when I see it though. He will probably remain hidden for some time.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I hope that helps you in your quest. Will you give my apologies to Ali Morrisane for treating his family so.");
%feud_var = ^feud_mayor_reveal;
%feud_bandit_boss_vis = 0;
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I think I may be able to put one more thing to right. I heard that your house was burgled recently. I think you should ask Ali 'The operator' about that, it may prove beneficial.");
~chatnpc("<p,quiz>How do you know this?");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>Let's just put it down to adventurer's intuition.");
